<title>POLAND: VISTULA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>VISTULA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.65 vs   1.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.41 vs   1.91</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.10 vs   1.65</p>
<p> Sales		    9.15 vs   8.27</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.50 vs   8.42</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	16.67 vs  13.14</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.17 vs  10.36</p>
<p> Sales		   91.33 vs  79.11</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Vistula SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
